Package: limpet-hald
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), usbutils
Description: Limpet USB RE-hardware detector (hal.py)
 Signature-based detector for RE/lab USB hardware (debug probes, logic
 analyzers, flash programmers, SDR receivers, target devices in boot/flash
 mode, ...). Exposes `limpet-hald detect` / `limpet-hald list-plugins` as one
 JSON document so an agent can check what hardware is attached before
 reaching for a hardware-specific tool.
